 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGroupe Horizon SA\n12 Rue de la République, 75008 Paris, France\nN° TVA: FR34 536931632\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\n\nFROM\n\nGroupe Horizon SA\n12 Rue de la République\n75008 Paris\nFrance\nVAT: FR34 536931632\n\nFACTURÉ À\n\nSociété Lumière SARL\n12 Rue de la République\n75008 Paris\nFrance\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 10/01/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Groupe\nHorizon SA, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Paris (\"Party A\"), and Société Lumière SARL, with its registered office\nat 12 Rue de la République, Paris (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\nParty A      Groupe Horizon SA / Pierre Martin\nParty B      Société Lumière SARL / Sophie Bernard\nDate         10/01/2026",
